esky&utm_medium=Social&title=DEM+Parti+ertelenen+kongresini+yapt%C4%B1%3A+Hatimo%C4%9Fullar%C4%B1+ve+Bak%C4%B1rhan+yeniden+E%C5%9F+Genel+Ba%C5%9Fkan","iconSharer":"\/images\/vector\/social-icons\/article-redesign-bluesky.svg","linkQueryParam":"text"},"telegram":{"name":"telegram","url":"https:\/\/t.me\/share\/url?url=https%3A%2F%2Ftr.euronews.com%2F2026%2F09%2F06%2Fdem-parti-ertelenen-kongresini-yapti-hatimogullari-ve-bakirhan-yeniden-es-genel-baskan&utm_source=Telegram&utm_medium=Social","iconSharer":"\/images\/vector\/social-icons\/article-redesign-telegram.svg","linkQueryParam":"url"},"threads":{"name":"threads","url":"https:\/\/threads.net\/intent\/post?text=https%3A%2F%2Ftr.euronews.com%2F2026%2F09%2F06%2Fdem-parti-ertelenen-kongresini-yapti-hatimogullari-ve-bakirhan-yeniden-es-genel-baskan&utm_source=Threads&utm_medium=Social","iconSharer":"\/images\/vector\/social-icons\/article-redesign-threads.svg","linkQueryParam":"text"},"whatsapp":{"name":"whatsapp","url":"whatsapp:\/\/send?text=https%3A%2F%2Ftr.euronews.com%2F2026%2F09%2F06%2Fdem-parti-ertelenen-kongresini-yapti-hatimogullari-ve-bakirhan-yeniden-es-genel-baskan&utm_source=Whatsapp&utm_medium=Social","iconSharer":"\/images\/vector\/social-icons\/article-redesign-whatsapp.svg","linkQueryParam":"text"}}},"entities":{"country":{"id":284,"urlSafeValue":"turkiye","title":"T\u00fcrkiye"},"continent":{"id":104,"urlSafeValue":"avrupa","title":"Avrupa"},"article":{"id":2923550,"cid":"9903278","livestream":[],"technicalTags":["features.textToSpeech.disable"],"relatedIds":[],"preferredRatio":"auto","program":{"id":"world","urlSafeValue":"dunya","title":"D\u00fcnya"},"isWire":false,"agencyKey":"euronews","masterCMS":"v2","adobeFromBreakingNews":false,"contentType":"normal","lastPublishedAt":1788709468,"createdAt":1788705517,"publishedAt":1788709468,"firstPublishedAt":1788709468,"lastModified":1788709468,"path":"\/2026\/09\/06\/dem-parti-ertelenen-kongresini-yapti-hatimogullari-ve-bakirhan-yeniden-es-genel-baskan","isMagazine":false,"leadin":"DEM Parti, bir s\u00fcredir ertelenen 5. Ola\u011fan Kongresi'ni Ankara'daki N\u00e2z\u0131m Hikmet K\u00fclt\u00fcr Merkezi'nde ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirdi. Kongrede, son 2 y\u0131ld\u0131r s\u00fcren \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcm tart\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131 ve yeni d\u00f6nem stratejileri \u00f6ne \u00e7\u0131kt\u0131.","pfpRelated":[],"title":"DEM Parti ertelenen kongresini yapt\u0131: Hatimo\u011fullar\u0131 ve Bak\u0131rhan yeniden E\u015f Genel Ba\u015fkan","versionId":"1","plainText":"Halklar\u0131n E\u015fitlik ve Demokrasi Partisi'nin (DEM Parti) 5. Ola\u011fan B\u00fcy\u00fck Kongresi pazar g\u00fcn\u00fc Ankara'da yap\u0131ld\u0131.\n\nGe\u00e7erli oylar\u0131n tamam\u0131n\u0131 (535) alarak yeniden se\u00e7ilen E\u015f Genel Ba\u015fkanlar T\u00fclay Hatimo\u011fullar\u0131 ve Tuncer Bak\u0131rhan, \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcm s\u00fcreci ve yeni d\u00f6neme ili\u015fkin kritik mesajlar verdi.\n\nKongrede partinin yetkili organlar\u0131 da belirlendi. 80 ki\u015filik Parti Meclisi\u2019ne (PM) 33 yeni isim se\u00e7ilirken, Merkez Disiplin Kurulu ve Uzla\u015fma Kurulu \u00fcyelikleri de yenilendi. DEM Parti kaynaklar\u0131; isim, t\u00fcz\u00fck ve geni\u015f kadro de\u011fi\u015fikliklerini kapsayacak as\u0131l b\u00fcy\u00fck kongrenin gelecek y\u0131l d\u00fczenlenece\u011fini aktard\u0131.\n\nBu kongre, \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcm s\u00fcreci g\u00f6lgesinde bir s\u00fcredir erteleniyordu.\n\nDEM Parti'nin bir \u00f6nceki kongresi 15 Ekim 2023'te ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilmi\u015fti.\n\nYe\u015fil Sol Parti ismi ile yap\u0131lan kongrede parti, \"DEM Parti\" ad\u0131n\u0131 alm\u0131\u015f, Bak\u0131rhan ve Hatimo\u011fullar\u0131 E\u015f Genel Ba\u015fkan se\u00e7ilmi\u015fti.\n\nSiyasi Partiler Yasas\u0131 ve parti t\u00fcz\u00fc\u011f\u00fc uyar\u0131nca b\u00fcy\u00fck kongrelerin, \u00f6nceki kongrenin \u00fczerinden en az 2, en fazla 3 y\u0131l ge\u00e7meden yap\u0131lmas\u0131 gerekiyor.\n\nHatimo\u011fullar\u0131: 'Silahlar\u0131n susmas\u0131 bar\u0131\u015f i\u00e7in tarihi bir f\u0131rsat'\n\nT\u00fclay Hatimo\u011fullar\u0131, yeniden se\u00e7ilmeden \u00f6nce yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 konu\u015fmada, silahlar\u0131n susmas\u0131n\u0131n toplumsal bar\u0131\u015f i\u00e7in tarihi bir f\u0131rsat sundu\u011funu belirtti.\n\nToplumsal helalle\u015fme ve m\u00fczakere vurgusu yapan Hatimo\u011fullar\u0131, \u015fu ifadeleri kulland\u0131: \"Ac\u0131lar yar\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131lmaz; her ac\u0131n\u0131n kendi hikayesi vard\u0131r ve bar\u0131\u015f bu ortak ac\u0131lar\u0131 bitirmeyi ama\u00e7lar. Y\u00fcz y\u0131ll\u0131k meseleler bir g\u00fcnde \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fclmez ancak kaderi bazen birka\u00e7 y\u0131l i\u00e7inde de\u011fi\u015febilir. Bizler bar\u0131\u015faca\u011f\u0131z, ba\u015faraca\u011f\u0131z. Bar\u0131\u015f\u0131 sadece silahlar\u0131n susmas\u0131 olarak de\u011fil, \u00e7ok daha geni\u015f bir toplumsal mutabakat olarak de\u011ferlendirmeliyiz.\"\n\nBak\u0131rhan: 'Art\u0131k maliyet \u00f6deme de\u011fil, hasat alma d\u00f6nemi'\n\nE\u015f Genel Ba\u015fkan Tuncer Bak\u0131rhan ise K\u00fcrt meselesinin \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcm\u00fcn\u00fcn t\u00fcm T\u00fcrkiye\u2019nin yarar\u0131na oldu\u011funu vurgulayarak, son yar\u0131m as\u0131rda \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcms\u00fczl\u00fck nedeniyle a\u011f\u0131r maliyetler \u00f6dendi\u011fini ifade etti.\n\nK\u00fcrt ve T\u00fcrk halklar\u0131n\u0131n \u00e7\u0131karlar\u0131n\u0131n ortak paydada bulu\u015ftu\u011funu belirten Bak\u0131rhan, \"K\u00fcrt\u2019\u00fcn kazan\u0131m\u0131 T\u00fcrkiye\u2019nin, T\u00fcrkiye\u2019nin kazan\u0131m\u0131 K\u00fcrt\u2019\u00fcn kazan\u0131m\u0131d\u0131r. Art\u0131k maliyet \u00f6deme de\u011fil, hasat alma d\u00f6nemidir. Memlekete bar\u0131\u015f imk\u00e2n\u0131 sunan, diyalog ve m\u00fczakerenin yolunu a\u00e7an ba\u015fta Say\u0131n (Abdullah) \u00d6calan olmak \u00fczere t\u00fcm siyasi akt\u00f6rlere te\u015fekk\u00fcr ediyorum,\" dedi.\n\n","advertising":0,"advertisingData":{"sponsorLogoReverse":"","endDate":0,"isDfp":false,"sponsorLogo":"","startDate":0},"isLiveCoverage":false,"canonical":"https:\/\/tr.euronews.com\/2026\/09\/06\/dem-parti-ertelenen-kongresini-yapti-hatimogullari-ve-bakirhan-yeniden-es-genel-baskan","country":{"id":284,"urlSafeValue":"turkiye","title":"T\u00fcrkiye"},"isBreakingNews":false,"type":"normal","numberWords":295,"isOpinion":false,"grapeshotCategories":[],"versions":{"tr":{"url":"dem-parti-ertelenen-kongresini-yapti-hatimogullari-ve-bakirhan-yeniden-es-genel-baskan","title":"DEM Parti ertelenen kongresini yapt\u0131: Hatimo\u011fullar\u0131 ve Bak\u0131rhan yeniden E\u015f Genel Ba\u015fkan","publishedAt":1788709468}},"daletEventName":"DEM party extraordinary congress","contextualSignals":{"doubleVerify":{"ids":["84011001","84112005"],"slugs":["arts_and_entertainment","law_gov_t_and_politics_legal_politics"]}},"isAutoPublished":false,"isAutoLocalised":false,"isReviewed":false,"daletPyramidId":6490396,"excludeSocialMedia":false,"hasVuukle":true},"image":{"defaultImagePath":"https:\/\/images.euronews.com\/articles\/stories\/09\/90\/32\/78\/1200x675_cmsv2_73dc116a-53c3-562a-aa71-c73f4f699ccf-9903278.jpg"},"keywords":[{"id":"12742","slug":"gathering","urlSafeValue":"toplant-","title":"Toplant\u0131"},{"id":"12061","slug":"peace-process","urlSafeValue":"cozum-sureci","title":"\u00c7\u00f6z\u00fcm s\u00fcreci "},{"id":"13824","slug":"peoples-democratic-party-turkey-","urlSafeValue":"halklar-n-demokratik-partisi","title":"Halklar\u0131n Demokratik Partisi"}],"program":{"id":"world","urlSafeValue":"dunya","title":"D\u00fcnya"},"theme":{"id":"news","urlSafeValue":"news","title":"D\u00fcnya"},"vertical":{"id":"news","title":"Haber","slug":"news"}},"services":{"advertising":{"fullAdUnit":"\/6458\/tr_euronews_new\/news\/news\/world","keyValues":{"lng":"tr","page":"article","video":"false","isBreakingNews":"false","vertical":"news","nws_id":"2923550","nwsctr_id":"9903278","article_type":"normal","program":"world","technical_tags":["features.textToSpeech.disable"],"source":"euronews","themes":["news"],"tags":["toplant-","cozum-sureci","halklar-n-demokratik-partisi"]},"slotSpecificKeyValues":{"native":{"ntvPlacement":"1108724"}},"fetchMarginPercent":30,"renderMarginPercent":25,"mobileScaling":1,"translations":{"common_advertisement":"Reklam"},"contextualSignals":{"doubleVerify":{"ids":["84011001","84112005"],"slugs":["arts_and_entertainment","law_gov_t_and_politics_legal_politics"]}},"disableAds":false},"insider":{"apiToken":"a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0e1f2a3b4c5d6"},"didomi":{"noticeId":"kXB3tpWh","sdkPath":"https:\/\/did.tech.euronews.com\/"}}});
    </script>
  
  <script>
  (function () {
    // TCF v2.2 core segment: version, lastUpdated, purpose 1 and the vendor 573 bit, read straight off the
    // stored string. Anything short or unexpected answers null, and null never preloads.
    function tcfCore(cookie) {
      var core = cookie.split('.')[0];
      var alphabet = 'ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz0123456789-_';
      function bits(offset, length) {
        var value = 0;
        for (var i = offset; i < offset + length; i++) {
          var position = Math.floor(i / 6);
          if (position >= core.length) return null;
          var index = alphabet.indexOf(core.charAt(position));
          if (index < 0) return null;
          value = value * 2 + ((index >> (5 - (i % 6))) & 1);
        }
        return value;
      }
      if (bits(0, 6) !== 2) return null;
      var updated = bits(42, 36);
      var purposes = bits(152, 24);
      var maxVendorId = bits(213, 16);
      var ranged = bits(229, 1);
      if (!updated || purposes === null || maxVendorId === null || ranged === null) return null;
      var vendor = null;
      if (maxVendorId >= 573) {
        if (!ranged) {
          vendor = bits(230 + 572, 1) === 1;
        } else {
          var count = bits(230, 12);
          if (count === null) return null;
          var cursor = 242;
          vendor = false;
          for (var n = 0; n < count; n++) {
            var isRange = bits(cursor, 1);
            var start = bits(cursor + 1, 16);
            if (isRange === null || start === null) return null;
            cursor += 17;
            var end = start;
            if (isRange) {
              end = bits(cursor, 16);
              if (end === null) return null;
              cursor += 16;
            }
            if (start <= 573 && 573 <= end) vendor = true;
          }
        }
      }
      return { lastUpdated: updated * 100, vendor: vendor, purpose1: ((purposes >> 23) & 1) === 1 };
    }

    // The lifetime comes from the notice, never from a constant: ours is 183 days where Didomi's default is
    // 366, and trusting the default would preload for a consent the CMP is about to re-collect.
    function declaredPlayer(data) {
      var entities = (data && data.entities) || {};
      var playerData = (entities.video && entities.video.playerData) || {};
      var override =
        data && data.page && data.page.platform === 'mobile'
          ? playerData.mobilePlayerData
          : playerData.desktopPlayerData;
      return (
        (override && override.player) || playerData.player || (entities.article && entities.article.player)
      );
    }

    // Both rules mirror consent/dailymotionGrant.ts: the lifetime comes from the notice, never a constant,
    // and `partnersChangedAt` dates the last publication that actually touched the partner list.
    function consentIsCurrent(consentedAt, now, lifetimeDays) {
      return lifetimeDays > 0 && Math.floor(consentedAt / 864e5) + lifetimeDays > Math.floor(now / 864e5);
    }

    function consentCoversNotice(consentedAt, partnersChangedAt) {
      var changedAt = Date.parse(partnersChangedAt);
      return !isNaN(changedAt) && Math.floor(consentedAt / 864e5) > Math.floor(changedAt / 864e5);
    }

    try {
      if (/(?:^|;\s*)euronews-refused-cookie-wall=/.test(document.cookie)) return;
      var match = /(?:^|;\s*)euconsent-v2=([^;]+)/.exec(document.cookie);
      if (!match) return;
      var core = tcfCore(decodeURIComponent(match[1]));
      if (!core || core.vendor !== true || !core.purpose1) return;
      var recorded = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('enw-consent-verdict') || 'null');
      if (!recorded || recorded.consentedAt !== core.lastUpdated) return;
      var data = window.getInitialServerData && window.getInitialServerData();
      if (declaredPlayer(data) !== 'dailymotion') return;
      var notice = data && data.services && data.services.didomi && data.services.didomi.noticeId;
      if (typeof notice !== 'string' || !notice || typeof fetch !== 'function') return;
      // Published so the bundle adopts this very call instead of firing its own: it asks before this one
      // answers, so the HTTP cache would not spare the second round-trip.
      // Same bound as the bundle's TIMEOUT_MS: once the page has given up waiting, the request stops too.
      var signal = typeof AbortSignal !== 'undefined' && AbortSignal.timeout ? AbortSignal.timeout(1500) : undefined;
      var pending = fetch('/api/consent-version/' + encodeURIComponent(notice), { credentials: 'omit', signal: signal }).then(
        function (response) {
          return response.ok ? response.json() : null;
        },
      );
      window.__enwNoticeVersion = pending;
      pending
        .then(function (version) {
          if (!version || typeof version.partnersChangedAt !== 'string') return;
          if (!consentIsCurrent(core.lastUpdated, Date.now(), version.consentLifetimeDays)) return;
          if (!consentCoversNotice(core.lastUpdated, version.partnersChangedAt)) return;
          if (document.head.querySelector('link[rel="preload"][href="https\u003A\/\/geo.dailymotion.com\/libs\/player\/x9oog.js"]')) return;
          var link = document.createElement('link');
          link.rel = 'preload';
          link.as = 'script';
          link.href = 'https\u003A\/\/geo.dailymotion.com\/libs\/player\/x9oog.js';
          document.head.appendChild(link);
          performance.mark('enw-dm-head-preload');
        })
        .catch(function () {
          /* the bundle path decides on its own */
        });
    } catch (error) {
      /* never break the head */
    }
  })();
</script>

